# U32: the shared item list (SharedItemListControl) and the rare template DB (ItemDBControl
# "RARE", layout b) of allflame_exp_001. Drag item-list row 1 onto the empty shared list
# (ReceiveDrag at its selDragIndex: a copy from BuildRaw), then row 2 above it; hover a shared
# row (the tooltip); double-click it (CreateDisplayItemFromRaw); Ctrl+C (OnSelCopy); drag it onto
# the item list (ItemListControl:ReceiveDrag: AddItem at the drop index); select row 2 and the
# Delete button (the confirm popup) with RETURN; the rare DB: the slot filter to Amulet, hover a
# row, Ctrl+click it (add and equip in Amulet: a recalc), search "a".
#! u32-layout b
#! u32-expect ^7Shared items:
#! u32-expect display: raw
#! u32-expect from the shared item list?
#! u32-expect Amulet
